# Automation Policy #
"AI SLOP" or "VIBE CODE" is code "generated" (regurgitated) by an AI algorithm.

**Rules:**
1. AI slop is detrimental to the integrity of the code base and will be rejected outright
2. Users submitting AI slop that goes undetected may be banned at my sole discretion
3. Other automation tools, such as documentation generators, visual scripting-to-code systems, Markov chains, things of that nature are totally fine and their inclusion is encouraged as long as they do not rely on machine learning.

The MultiGame Component Reference documentation is generated by Robin Templeton, using some very clever scripts, and can be found at https://terpri.org/mgdoc/
